+On Claude Code 2.1.293 / Opus 5.5 and Cursor Agent 2026.10.22-27dcf5f / Gemini 4 Argon High, explicit invocations read unpredictable tokens from relative assets of disposable plaintext aliases. Explicit-only metadata was preserved. The observed Claude project-skill/legacy-command winner and Cursor `.agents`/`.cursor` winner establish only those fixture cases. Both explicit invocation streams contained resource Reads without a Skill tool call, so counting only that tool call would miss these invocations; startup inventories do not establish usage. No native activation-counter coverage was certified.
